---
import MarketingLayout from '@/layouts/MarketingLayout.astro'
import Section from '@/components/marketing/Section.astro'
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Security, Governance, and Operational Control"
  description="Quatro is built for critical infrastructure teams that need intelligence they can trust, govern, audit, and own."
>
  <Section>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em]" style="color: var(--color-forest);">Security</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-800 sm:text-5xl">Security, governance, and operational control</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
        Quatro is built for critical infrastructure teams that need intelligence they can trust, govern, audit, and own. We integrate operational systems into governed workflows without removing human accountability.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-6">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-800">Agents propose. Humans decide. Every action is auditable.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
          Quatro keeps operators, analysts, engineers, and domain experts in the loop. Recommendations, escalations, and automated actions can be reviewed, approved, traced, and governed by the customer’s rules.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        {[
          {
            title: 'Human-approved automation',
            body: 'AI agents can monitor, classify, draft, recommend, and coordinate. High-consequence actions stay inside customer-defined approval paths.'
          },
          {
            title: 'Signed audit chain',
            body: 'Events, recommendations, approvals, and actions should be traceable from source signal to operational outcome.'
          },
          {
            title: 'Customer-owned deployment',
            body: 'The operational model, data flows, workflows, and deployment are designed around customer ownership from day one.'
          },
          {
            title: 'Role-based access',
            body: 'Teams can separate executive, operator, engineer, analyst, partner, and support access by responsibility and context.'
          },
          {
            title: 'Data residency options',
            body: 'Deployment patterns can support cloud, hybrid, on-prem, edge, and sovereign requirements where the operating environment requires them.'
          },
          {
            title: 'Security review ready',
            body: 'Security documentation, architecture details, and control mappings are available for qualified enterprise and public-sector evaluations.'
          }
        ].map((item) => (
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-neutral-800">{item.title}</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">{item.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-neutral mt-12 max-w-none">
        <h2>Core controls</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Encryption for data in transit and at rest where deployed.</li>
          <li>Role-based access control and environment-specific permissions.</li>
          <li>Audit logging for operational events, recommendations, approvals, and actions.</li>
          <li>Human approval workflows for high-consequence actions.</li>
          <li>Deployment patterns for cloud, hybrid, on-prem, edge, and air-gapped environments where required.</li>
          <li>Security documentation and control mappings available under NDA.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Responsible disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          If you discover a security vulnerability, please report it to <a href="mailto:security@quatro.io">security@quatro.io</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>
</MarketingLayout>
